<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED JUNE 23.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED JUNE 23.</headline>
<text>
<p>(Updates with cut in central bank main interest rate</p>
<p>effective June 23)</p>
<p>Central exchange rate-Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) daily fix:</p>
<p>Levs/dollar 1,693.20(June 23) 495.74(Dec30) 70.719(Dec30'95)</p>
<p>Broad money, bln levs:</p>
<p>3,734.7(June 6) 3,491.8(May30) 3,138.4(Apr 25) 3,200.6(Mar 28)</p>
<p>M1 nominal, bln levs:  754.1 June 6</p>
<p>M1 pct change +6.72 (June 6-May 30); +21.85 (May 30-Apr 25)</p>
<p>M2 nominal, bln levs: 3,526.4 June 6</p>
<p>M2 pct change +6.61 (June 6-May 30); +11.13 (May 30-Apr 25)</p>
<p>Central bank total refinancing, bln levs:</p>
<p>54.577 (June6) 54.577 (May30) 54.577 (May23) 54.826 (Apr25)</p>
<p>Central interest rate - 16.30 pct effective annual from June</p>
<p>23 (42.24 pct June 16-22)</p>
<p>Money market lev funds rate, annual - 30-40 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
</text>
